<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>愛情 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85/</link><description>Recent content in 愛情 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>星座能看出誰不忠誠嗎？五種常見感情標籤</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;朋友說「那個星座都很花心」，你可能會想起某段不愉快的關係。但&lt;strong&gt;出生日期不能判定一個人是否忠誠&lt;/strong&gt;。與其列出「最渣」排行榜，不如看看常見標籤背後，真正需要談的是什麼。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星座配對怎麼看？比相容度更有用的四個問題</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;看到「你們的星座很合」，心裡可能鬆一口氣；看到「不合」，又開始擔心。星座配對可以拿來聊彼此的期待，&lt;strong&gt;不能替你判斷一個人會不會尊重你&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>